  "title": "Simple Salmon Chowder II",
  "description": "This is a hearty but mild flavored fish chowder. It's a great way to use a piece of salmon that's too small to do much else with. Serve with toasted sourdough bread.",
  "authors": [
    "Chris Smith"
  ],
